{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>I am El, the God of your father.</b> I restrained him from going down to Egypt, and I said to him, 'Do not go down to Egypt' (Genesis 26:2) — and now you are going down to Egypt: do not fear the descent to Egypt. And thus Scripture says (Isaiah 41:14): ״אל תיראי תולעת יעקב״ — 'Fear not, you worm Jacob,' etc.; and it is written (Isaiah 41:10): ״אל תירא כי עמך אני אל תשתע כי אני אלהיך״ — 'Fear not, for I am with you; be not dismayed, for I am your Elohim.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :register {:flags {0 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:20:37.014188290Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}